  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Equality and Women&#x2019;s Empowerment Program (GEWEP) III - Norway</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women and girls in target areas in Afghanistan, Burundi, DRC, Mali, Myanmar, Niger, Rwanda facing poverty, inequality, violence, and social exclusion (of whom 1 402 000 will be direct participants) are empowered to claim and realize their full human rights, and live free from insecurity and discrimination.  Increase knowledge of SRHR and training of health staff on SRHR service provision, and tranform norms relating to gender-based violence.</narrative>
  </description>
